				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ジュジュベ『ほーら
お・い・つ・い・た！▼
さあ　観念なさい！</Text>
